  "about": {
    "title": "About Promos 2019",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Promos 2019 gathers the 39 promo cards from 24 products released in 2019: Yu-Gi-Oh! World Championship 2019 Japanese National Qualifiers prize cards, Yu-Gi-Oh! Advent Calendar, Chaos Impact Special Edition, Chaos Impact Sneak Peek Participation Card, Dark Neostorm Special Edition, Dark Neostorm Sneak Peek Participation Card, Speed Duel: Scars of Battle Launch Event participation card, WSJ Jump Pack Spring 2019 promotional card, The Lost Art Promotion G, The Lost Art Promotion H, The Lost Art Promotion I, The Lost Art Promotion J, The Lost Art Promotion K, The Lost Art Promotion L, The Lost Art Promotion M, Yu-Gi-Oh! Legacy of the Duelist: Link Evolution promotional cards, Rising Rampage Special Edition, Rising Rampage Sneak Peek Participation Card, Savage Strike Special Edition, Savage Strike Sneak Peek Participation Card, Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V Volume 5 promotional card, Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V Volume 6 promotional card, Yu-Gi-Oh! Championship Series 2019 prize card and Yu-Gi-Oh! Day April 2019 promotional card.",
      "Choose what you’re collecting: the <b>Standard set</b> (the 39 cards, each in its main rarity) or the <b>Master set</b> (all 40, adding the 1 other rarity).",
      "This free checklist lets you tick off the cards you own, count spare copies for trading, see your progress by rarity and plan your binder pages. It works on phones and computers, even offline, and your collection stays on your device.",
      "Card details and images come from YGOPRODeck, and prices from TCGplayer."
    ]
  },
